{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_03_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eab852634c64ba3f4e69977057c874bc1fd540df2a9257c4b46d0c864819c3e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:553d5d600ea3ba720adbedc3191e2108e9c3667a6bf6831a4f82bc37b09dbc9f",
      "text": "巧合交织即必然",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2a3602c4b00fd2343a92b450b6a1ad306e240983b1620f05ed1bde249a2b2b",
      "text": "大吾和一希决定参加315 Pro的试镜。试镜当天，一希偶然遇见了凉，并一同前往事务所。随后与大吾汇合。受到凉鼓舞的两人，迎向了试镜的挑战。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:553d5d600ea3ba720adbedc3191e2108e9c3667a6bf6831a4f82bc37b09dbc9f",
      "text": "巧合交织即必然",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe47635a170f26caae560c94c80a130957b552e8d2f6aab5827da016312bb7c4",
      "text": "喂，你们看这条新闻了吗？\n写着“秋月凉，从315 Pro重新出发！？”呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76c8d3e4565c0a3188fc915350e3e4cd189309310c7785904986e073713a8fc9",
      "text": "哇，好厉害啊。\n今后真的要作为男生进行活动了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7de02ace5ea8c3e1f8c1dafdd2a05bdd41d1b4b5453829cfe27b26c1c0a39771",
      "text": "那个节目，真是吓了一跳啊！\n不过，不管是怎样的凉酱我都会支持的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199df173ed9eb56ceb329181796e68effec32a3ccebfa2430932259a663c4107",
      "text": "（……没想到俺会被那个315 Pro的制作人，\n邀请去参加试镜啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:458a29244363ff14754f227f8bdc42b95e10e5aa091936abdb227d11278f9d40",
      "text": "（嚯，试镜也有很多种啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bce96ab14efcc6ef39de694c6d4160b8cce6b8dc0c6bfd59a5e448d8c3268bbb",
      "text": "（有315 Pro单独举办的，\n也有和其他各个事务所联合举办的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df725fb9d76ee1912d05f2afa3d27d7d4a7b063b0e79286e03aa3974256297c",
      "text": "（两边看起来都很有意思，选不出来啊～！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5d67b2554ec8b8410a3a1097e702922e86cbb5470ac603fda2aeac9efd47aa3",
      "text": "（……因为与凉相遇而了解到的，\n偶像这份给人带来笑容的工作）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:193ec95c9fc5b1ebc62dacab042aa22eda09a172b428eb3f650dcb05e246fa77",
      "text": "（越听就觉得越有趣啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_03_1_1_014_03:1_1_014_03_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23ea785a61dde9f736a22c43cbba6426ce666d0a439c11045ded404cf33947b0",
      "text": "……嗯？这个名字是……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
